# Playing: MUTE held makes white keys 1-8 the mute map: keys 2 and 3 mute
# tracks 2 and 3, and MUTE's release mutes nothing more; held again, key 2
# brings track 2 back.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:PLAY/STOP
--key 0.50:13:100:0.5
--key 0.60:2:100:0.05
--key 0.70:4:100:0.05
--key 1.50:13:100:0.3
--key 1.60:2:100:0.05
